t\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(35,20005540,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/staff-cabinet/','Staff Cabinet','bookly-addon-staff-cabinet','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/personal-staff-cabinet-employees/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-staff-cabinet.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-staff-cabinet.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2017-05-26 16:11:36',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"With the Bookly Staff Cabinet (Add-on), you can set up and provide each employee with their own personal account to manage their calendars, details, schedules, and other settings directly on the front end of your site. This eliminates the need for staff members to access the WordPress admin panel. By allowing employees to log in to their own Staff Cabinet, you can streamline the appointment management process and improve efficiency.\",\"tags\":[\"Staff & Teams\",\"Automation\"],\"short\":\"A front-end panel for staff to run their day.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":39,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":12.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(36,19617518,0,0,'','PayPal Payments Standard','bookly-addon-paypal-payments-standard','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/paypal-standard-payments/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-paypal-payments-standard.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-paypal-payments-standard.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2017-03-22 04:29:25',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"If you\\u2019re looking for a hassle-free way to process online payments during the booking process, Bookly PayPal Payments Standard (Add-on) is the perfect solution for you. By integrating this add-on with your Bookly PRO booking form, you can offer your customers a secure and popular payment gateway to pay via credit card or PayPal account. With all payments processed through PayPal, you can rest assured that the transaction is safe and reliable.\",\"tags\":[\"Payments\",\"Integrations\"],\"short\":\"The classic PayPal redirect checkout.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(37,19497634,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/recurring/','Recurring Appointments','bookly-addon-recurring-appointments','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/recurring-appointments/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-recurring-appointments.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-recurring-appointments.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2017-02-23 17:42:00',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Do you want to streamline your clients\\u2019 booking experience and encourage them to schedule regular visits? With the Bookly Recurring Appointments (Add-on), you can easily allow clients to schedule appointments weeks or months in advance. This feature allows you to automate the process of creating a series of appointments at a custom repeat interval, making it simple for clients to schedule regular appointments with just a few clicks in the Bookly booking form.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Booking form\",\"Automation\"],\"short\":\"Weekly and monthly repeats in one booking.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":39,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":12.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(38,18874038,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/srv-schedule/','Service Schedule','bookly-addon-service-schedule','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/limit-service-availability/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-service-schedule.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-service-schedule.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-11-22 05:03:19',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Do you offer unique types of services that are only available during specific times or days? With the Bookly Service Schedule (Add-on), you can easily limit the availability of your services to specific hours or days. This allows staff members to follow their regular schedules but booking times for a specific service only appear in the Bookly form when they overlap with the staff\\u2019s working hours.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Staff & Teams\"],\"short\":\"Hours that differ per service, not per staff.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(39,18704535,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/special-hours/','Special Hours','bookly-addon-special-hours','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/set-flexible-prices/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-special-hours.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-special-hours.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-11-09 01:22:54',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Do you want to offer flexible pricing options for your services? With the Bookly Special Hours (Add-on), you can easily set up dynamic pricing based on the time of day or day of the week. You can offer discounted rates for morning appointments or increase prices for evening or weekend bookings. This allows you to tailor your pricing to the needs of your business and customers.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Staff & Teams\",\"Payments\"],\"short\":\"Per-service pricing and hours for each provider.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(40,18611122,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/special-days/','Special Days','bookly-addon-special-days','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/add-special-days-staffs-schedules/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-special-days.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-special-days.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-11-07 01:25:43',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Bookly Special Days (Add-on) enables you to change the default working hours of your staff on specific days of the year. This means you can create customized work schedules that differ from the regular ones, such as shorter or longer workdays, including breaks. These special days\\u2019 working hours will be taken into account when Bookly checks the service provider\\u2019s availability, providing your clients with accurate booking times.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Staff & Teams\"],\"short\":\"Holidays and exceptions across the calendar.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":39,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":12.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(41,17956131,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/deposit/','Deposit Payments','bookly-addon-deposit-payments','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/accept-deposit-payments/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-deposit-payments.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-deposit-payments.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-09-22 18:11:00',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Do you want to minimize the number of missed appointments and reduce cancellations? With the Bookly Deposit Payments (Add-on), you can require clients to pay a deposit at the time of booking to secure their appointment. By collecting a portion of the service cost in advance, you can minimize the risk of no-shows and ensure that the client is committed to their appointment. The remaining amount can then be paid offline when the client arrives for their appointment.\",\"tags\":[\"Payments\",\"Booking form\"],\"short\":\"Let customers pay part of the price upfront.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":39,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":12.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(42,17457141,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/multiply/','Multiply Appointments','bookly-addon-multiply-appointments','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/multiply-appointments/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-multiply-appointments.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-multiply-appointments.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-08-16 16:02:12',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Let your clients determine the length of their visit by booking back to back sessions of the same service. Bookly Multiply Appointments (Add-on) makes it possible for your clients to select a number of appointments they would like to get in a row with the same service provider. Bookly will automatically calculate the price of such reservation and offer time slots that can accommodate the stated number of identical appointments.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Booking form\"],\"short\":\"Repeat the same booking across several slots.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(43,17367838,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/chain/','Chain Appointments','bookly-addon-chain-appointments','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/chain-bookings/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-chain-appointments.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-chain-appointments.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-08-09 17:40:29',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Let your clients book several consecutive appointments in one visit. With the Bookly Chain Appointments (Add-on), your clients can choose multiple services from different staff members at the first step of the booking process. Bookly will find available time slots when all services can be delivered sequentially during a single visit.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Booking form\"],\"short\":\"Sequences of linked visits booked together.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(44,17328208,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/locations/','Locations','bookly-addon-locations','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/add-service-locations/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-locations.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-locations.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-08-03 17:49:31',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Does your company operate in more than one place? Bookly Locations (Add-on) makes it possible to associate staff members and services with different locations, so your clients can pick where they prefer to receive services before they schedule a date and time for their visit.\",\"tags\":[\"Staff & Teams\",\"Booking form\"],\"short\":\"Multiple venues with their own staff and hours.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":39,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":12.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(45,15552320,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/extras/','Service Extras','bookly-addon-service-extras','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/add-extras-services/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-service-extras.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-service-extras.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2016-04-01 15:29:11',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Bookly Service Extras (Add-on) allows you to offer extra items, services, products, equipment, or options that customers can book along with the regular appointment created via Bookly. These additional items can affect the overall price and duration of the appointment as selected by the client.\",\"tags\":[\"Booking form\",\"Payments\"],\"short\":\"Paid add-ons customers pick alongside a service.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":49,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":15.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(46,13903524,0,0,'','Multisite','bookly-addon-multisite','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-multisite.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-multisite.jpg',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2015-12-04 16:38:03',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Bookly Multisite (Add-on) enables you to use a single instance of the Bookly plugin across your entire Multisite network. This means that each site within your network will have its own unique list of services, staff members, appointments, and settings. It\\u2019s an efficient and convenient way to manage your bookings across multiple sites from a single point of access.\",\"tags\":[\"Staff & Teams\",\"Automation\"],\"short\":\"Run Bookly across a WordPress network.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":49,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":15.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(47,20250716,0,0,'https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/demo/events/','Events','bookly-addon-events','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/events/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-events.png','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/banners/bookly-addon-events.png',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2026-11-03 17:02:19',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"Events (Add-on) allows you to create and manage events with various ticket types. Customers can buy tickets through a dedicated events form, while you easily track attendees in the admin panel.\",\"tags\":[\"Calendar & Sync\",\"Marketing\",\"Booking form\"],\"badge\":\"Sale\",\"short\":\"Sell seats for classes and one-off events.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":9.95,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":\"year\",\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}]},\"requires\":\"bookly-addon-pro\"}}',NULL,1,'2026-10-11 06:59:24'),(48,20260518,0,0,'','Square','bookly-addon-square','','https://www.booking-wp-plugin.com/add-ons/square/','https://cloud.bookly.pro/public_resources/images/bookly-addon-square.png','',0.00,NULL,0,0.00,0,'2026-11-03 17:02:19',1,NULL,'{\"i18n\":{\"en\":{\"long\":\"With Square Payments enabled, you can seamlessly integrate the Square payment gateway into your Bookly booking form, allowing clients to conveniently pay for your services online.\",\"tags\":[\"Payments\",\"Integrations\"],\"short\":\"Take Square payments without leaving the form.\"}},\"shared\":{\"prices\":{\"lifetime\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"amount\":29,\"list_amount\":null,\"currency\":\"USD\",\"period\":null,\"on_sale\":false,\"sale_ends_at\":null}],\"subscription\":[{\"quantity\":1,\"a